WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.253 --> 00:00:02.836
(cars roaring)

00:00:04.379 --> 00:00:07.480
(people chatting and clanking dishes)

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:08.537
- You can do this.

00:00:08.537 --> 00:00:09.384
It's not hard.

00:00:09.384 --> 00:00:10.487
Tell her how you feel.

00:00:10.487 --> 00:00:12.664
Give her the card and then leave.

00:00:12.664 --> 00:00:13.639
Give her the card.

00:00:13.639 --> 00:00:14.690
Tell her how you feel.

00:00:14.690 --> 00:00:15.642
Leave.

00:00:15.642 --> 00:00:16.674
Give her the card.

00:00:16.674 --> 00:00:18.103
Tell her how you feel.

00:00:18.103 --> 00:00:18.936
Move on.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:21.833
- Hey man.

00:00:22.747 --> 00:00:24.164
I believe in you.

00:00:26.427 --> 00:00:28.146
- Uh...thanks.

00:00:28.146 --> 00:00:30.396
Your support means so much.

00:00:31.324 --> 00:00:33.373
- Oh yeah, listen,
confronting your feelings?

00:00:33.373 --> 00:00:35.332
Difficult stuff.

00:00:35.332 --> 00:00:36.731
You should be proud of yourself.

00:00:36.731 --> 00:00:37.564
- Yeah

00:00:37.564 --> 00:00:38.860
- Put her there.

00:00:38.860 --> 00:00:41.360
(jazzy music)

00:00:56.670 --> 00:00:59.003
(loud slap)

00:01:01.287 --> 00:01:03.954
(playful music)

00:01:05.185 --> 00:01:06.018
- Hey.

00:01:07.800 --> 00:01:09.314
You're on time?

00:01:09.314 --> 00:01:11.258
- Yeah, aren't I always?

00:01:11.258 --> 00:01:12.818
- Not at all.

00:01:12.818 --> 00:01:15.402
You were late to our graduation.

00:01:15.402 --> 00:01:17.644
- I had trouble putting on my dress.

00:01:17.644 --> 00:01:19.458
- I thought it was traffic.

00:01:19.458 --> 00:01:22.274
- Bottom line is I'm here.

00:01:22.274 --> 00:01:23.674
- Where's Eric?

00:01:23.674 --> 00:01:25.864
- Uh, he's not coming.

00:01:25.864 --> 00:01:28.364
- Oh, is he sick or something?

00:01:29.403 --> 00:01:31.669
- No, I just thought it would be nice

00:01:31.669 --> 00:01:34.086
if it was just the two of us.

00:01:34.954 --> 00:01:37.871
(oppressive music)

00:01:53.843 --> 00:01:55.654
- Oh, alright,

00:01:55.654 --> 00:01:58.531
so I can't stay too long, so I...

00:01:58.531 --> 00:01:59.430
- What?

00:01:59.430 --> 00:02:00.263
We made reservations.

00:02:00.263 --> 00:02:01.096
- I know, I'm sorry,

00:02:01.096 --> 00:02:02.766
but I just have to get-

00:02:02.766 --> 00:02:05.685
- Michael, what's going on with you?

00:02:05.685 --> 00:02:07.094
- Nothing.

00:02:07.094 --> 00:02:08.399
- It's never been this bad.

00:02:08.399 --> 00:02:10.605
- What's never been this bad?

00:02:10.605 --> 00:02:11.645
- It.

00:02:11.645 --> 00:02:12.478
It.

00:02:14.029 --> 00:02:16.069
- I just like things a certain way.

00:02:16.069 --> 00:02:17.724
- Yeah, but it gets worse
when you're depressed.

00:02:17.724 --> 00:02:18.557
- Fine.

00:02:18.557 --> 00:02:19.390
I've been stressed a little.

00:02:19.390 --> 00:02:20.998
- Depressed.

00:02:20.998 --> 00:02:21.831
- Can you please just--

00:02:21.831 --> 00:02:23.135
- Hello everybody!

00:02:23.135 --> 00:02:27.302
Welcome to Cafe Blah's
open mic, LA's best comedy.

00:02:28.446 --> 00:02:29.287
Who am I kidding.

00:02:29.287 --> 00:02:30.861
None of this matters.

00:02:30.861 --> 00:02:32.940
You don't care, I don't care.

00:02:32.940 --> 00:02:35.006
Alright, let's do this.

00:02:35.006 --> 00:02:37.879
First guy, Brian O'Barron.

00:02:37.879 --> 00:02:39.071
Come on up here.

00:02:39.071 --> 00:02:41.904
(people chatting)

00:02:43.865 --> 00:02:45.032
- Yeah, I get it.

00:02:45.032 --> 00:02:46.545
I'm a white male.

00:02:46.545 --> 00:02:47.378
So what.

00:02:49.008 --> 00:02:49.841
- Here.

00:02:50.808 --> 00:02:52.271
Just open it.

00:02:52.271 --> 00:02:54.854
(box crinkles)

00:02:59.827 --> 00:03:01.738
- Michael, are you out of your mind?

00:03:01.738 --> 00:03:02.571
- I'm sorry?

00:03:02.571 --> 00:03:03.404
- I can't accept this.

00:03:03.404 --> 00:03:04.237
This is too much.

00:03:04.237 --> 00:03:05.070
- It's fine.

00:03:05.070 --> 00:03:05.903
It's what you always wanted.

00:03:05.903 --> 00:03:06.819
- Right, but I wanted
to get it for myself.

00:03:06.819 --> 00:03:07.901
- Yeah, but we've been friends

00:03:07.901 --> 00:03:09.597
for like eight years (mumbles)

00:03:09.597 --> 00:03:12.612
- And then my mom told me
about how sick I make my dad.

00:03:12.612 --> 00:03:16.531
I guess that's why I can't
smell lavender anymore.

00:03:16.531 --> 00:03:18.216
- Is this an alpha print?

00:03:18.216 --> 00:03:19.049
- Yeah.

00:03:19.049 --> 00:03:19.949
- Jesus Christ.

00:03:19.949 --> 00:03:21.291
- Think of it as a wedding gift.

00:03:21.291 --> 00:03:24.874
- Okay, next up we have
Terrance Abbegetty.

00:03:25.715 --> 00:03:28.225
(light applause)

00:03:28.225 --> 00:03:31.690
(people chatting)

00:03:31.690 --> 00:03:35.940
- Man, this morning I was (beep).

00:03:35.940 --> 00:03:37.714
And there was (beep)

00:03:37.714 --> 00:03:40.525
who was an (beep).

00:03:40.525 --> 00:03:42.050
- I can't accept this.

00:03:42.050 --> 00:03:44.523
- Mara, I need you to take this.

00:03:44.523 --> 00:03:47.219
I went through too much
for you to just reject it.

00:03:47.219 --> 00:03:48.147
- That was your decision.

00:03:48.147 --> 00:03:49.082
You don't put this on me.

00:03:49.082 --> 00:03:51.084
- It's always been on you.

00:03:51.084 --> 00:03:52.834
It's always been you.

00:03:57.099 --> 00:03:59.084
- Have you talked to Dr. Lyn recently?

00:03:59.084 --> 00:04:00.051
- Did you hear what I just said?

00:04:00.051 --> 00:04:00.976
- Yes, I heard you.

00:04:00.976 --> 00:04:01.853
But as much as you want to unload

00:04:01.853 --> 00:04:02.686
whatever you're going through on me,

00:04:02.686 --> 00:04:03.745
I'm not going to let you.

00:04:03.745 --> 00:04:04.725
- Just take the goddamn card.

00:04:04.725 --> 00:04:07.808
(people fall silent)

00:04:10.212 --> 00:04:12.295
- I believed in you, man.

00:04:13.868 --> 00:04:15.539
- I'm gonna go.

00:04:15.539 --> 00:04:16.595
Call Dr. Lyn.

00:04:16.595 --> 00:04:18.403
I will check on you tomorrow.

00:04:18.403 --> 00:04:19.811
- And if you just think about it,

00:04:19.811 --> 00:04:21.396
even for just this one brief moment,

00:04:21.396 --> 00:04:23.875
I get to be up here channeling, you know,

00:04:23.875 --> 00:04:26.011
all of these dreams.

00:04:26.011 --> 00:04:27.395
If someone has a 100 dollars,

00:04:27.395 --> 00:04:29.395
I just need 100 bucks and that's it.

00:04:29.395 --> 00:04:32.145
(brooding music)

00:04:56.216 --> 00:04:59.299
(car engine rattles)

00:05:05.026 --> 00:05:08.193
(loud, ominous music)

00:05:27.528 --> 00:05:30.343
(chair scraping)

00:05:30.343 --> 00:05:33.010
(phone ringing)

00:05:35.928 --> 00:05:36.761
- Hello?

00:05:39.234 --> 00:05:41.567
(bags thud)

00:05:43.576 --> 00:05:46.076
(siren wails)

